# 🧠 PHASE 3: PRIVILEGE ENUMERATION

## 🆔 Domain SID

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --get-sid

## 👑 Admin Accounts

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --admin-count

## 👥 Group Membership

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass -M groupmembership -o USER="target"

## 👨‍👩‍👧 Group Members

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass -M group-mem -o GROUP="Domain admins"
